  "arrangerNotes": "Pentatonic melody, so no accidentals to remove. Verified against the Wikipedia LilyPond score. 'we'll' is the same 6 as 'syne' (some session settings put it on the high 1 instead). Lyric line breaks follow the phrases; slurred notes in the score carry one syllable over two notes. Range low 5 to 6, minLayout 11 on both drums. Medium because of the dotted rhythms. C and D arrangements use identical degree sequences (both fit their drums).",
  "verified": true
